# The fire rain's cost (reports/content/remaster/magic-fire/rain.md) on the meadow east of the tavern: four casts, each
# measured for 8 s from 0.6 s after the cast, while its gobs fall, land and burn on the grass (the rain lasts 6.5 s):
# the whole rain from 18 m aside at night (view-1), at the hero from 4.5 m at night (view-2), the whole rain from 18 m
# aside at noon (view-3), the camera inside the rain at a man's height looking up into the falling gobs (view-4).
# Compare sets with scripts/perf-content.sh A B firerain. Animated draws are hidden on both sides.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 22 0
cadence normal
overlay off
ui off
view full
view hide animated morph
goto NW_TAVERNE_TROLLAREA_03
clear 3000
stats mana 3000 circle 6
equip ItRu_Firerain
tap spell
# Ten real seconds after the teleport for loading and native simulation.
wait 10000
set time 22 0
watch player
cam follow 1800 450 70
wait 2000
cam hold
wait 1000
press action
wait 1500
press forward
wait 300
release forward
wait 300
release action
wait 600
perf sample perf-firerain/view-1
wait 8000
perf stop
wait 1500
cam follow 450 160 40
wait 2000
cam hold
wait 1000
press action
wait 1500
press forward
wait 300
release forward
wait 300
release action
wait 600
perf sample perf-firerain/view-2
wait 8000
perf stop
wait 1500
set time 12 0
cam follow 1800 450 70
wait 2000
cam hold
wait 1000
press action
wait 1500
press forward
wait 300
release forward
wait 300
release action
wait 600
perf sample perf-firerain/view-3
wait 8000
perf stop
wait 1500
cam look 900
cam follow 300 170 150
wait 2000
cam hold
wait 1000
press action
wait 1500
press forward
wait 300
release forward
wait 300
release action
wait 600
perf sample perf-firerain/view-4
wait 8000
perf stop
wait 1500
# the app cadence window is 30 s from `cadence normal`: let it end
cadence wait
